# Cursor & Windsurf Rules for iDirectory Context Engineering
# Always adhere to the Two-Tier Bootloader defined in AGENTS.md:
# Tier 1 (Atomic): AGENTS.md -> .context/tree.json -> target .context.yaml (Do NOT load 01_seed)
# Tier 2 (Architecture): Triggered only on /seedMaster, /metrics or explicit architectural design
# Honor crawl: false on dead branches (data/raw, data/processed, logs, artifacts/plans/archive)
# Subfolders inherit directives recursively from parent beacons.
# Use `python FWengine.py route "<file>" --move` to place files canonically.

